*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*6 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5.33~8.67 seconds<sup>160f~260f</sup>.
*8 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Project A]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Maawth]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Vermilingua Rangmaster]] spawns as the boss.
**30 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**7 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[THE FOLIVOREAN]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a bump up in difficulty compared to the last couple stages. The start of the level can push you to your base if unprepared, so bring an anti-alien unit such as [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]]. No anti Starred Alien crystals are necessary, as there's only the one Project A.

On base hit, a Vermilingua Rangmaster will spawn, followed shortly after by a THE FOLIVOREAN. Use [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon Cat]] to outrange both, using 3 or 4 meat shields to keep both at bay. Piercing units such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs Cat]] will do you well, as well as Shield Piercers.

